  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Ever since SDK 21.07.08.15.57 (the one that added dropdowns for events and variables: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202131) there has been a noticeable decrease in graph responsiveness in larger graphs.\nVideo showcasing the issue:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sWSBz2ikBzQ\nIn the video I'm using the exact same large graph in two different projects with the different SDKs. The first part is the older SDK, which responds fairly fast. The second part is the latest SDK which is noticeably much slower.\nAttached is the picture of the full graph which I forgot to include in the video. The google drive file below is the graph asset which will work between both SDKs (Pardon the mess. Some things also had to be gutted from the graph so that it would work in both SDK versions)\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1IBAzRxkDMqcKpgSbisi-axB9FC-BoJKh/view?usp=sharing",
